+  - path: core/grounding/glossary.md
+    what: "the Drive entry: \"stops only to ask a question that comes up mid-run\"."
+  - path: core/components/plays/intent/
+    what: >-
+      reference/ice.md C4 ("the drive may still ask its questions") and C5 ("Nothing invented:
+      every outcome, reason, proof and limit traces either to what the source shows or to the
