+  - path: core/components/plays/vision/
+    what: >-
+      reference/ice.md C11 and SKILL.md pre-flight: "A question neither the contract nor the
+      model answers — no intents and no goal — stops the run and asks the person; the play never
+      picks an answer itself" — widens to all of memory and the system.
+  - path: core/components/plays/understand/
+    what: >-
+      reference/ice.md C13 and SKILL.md Step 1: "an absent capability with no seed answers —
+      stops the run and asks the person"; scripts/pick_targets.py and
